(QGCoder demo - a pocket, a bored hole and a chamfered rim)
(Nothing here needs a tool table: no M6, so the interpreter's)
(built-in default tool is used as-is.)

G21 (millimetres)
G90 (absolute)
G17 (XY plane)
G40 (cutter compensation off)

S2000 M3 (spindle on, clockwise)
F400

G0 Z10.000
G0 X-40.000 Y-30.000

(--- outside contour, three passes 2 mm apart ---)
G0 Z1.000
G1 Z-2.000
G1 X40.000 Y-30.000
G1 X40.000 Y30.000
G1 X-40.000 Y30.000
G1 X-40.000 Y-30.000
